# Allowlist, not a denylist: everything in this directory is ignored unless it
# is explicitly re-included below.
#
# The cloned tscircuit repos live here as siblings, and each is an INDEPENDENT
# git checkout. They must never be tracked by this repo: `git add core/` on a
# nested checkout does not fail, it silently records a gitlink (mode 160000) —
# an accidental submodule pinning someone's local SHA. An allowlist makes that
# structurally impossible, and it also keeps personal scratch (session notes,
# .bak dirs, exported images, snapshots) out by default.
#
# To share a new workspace file, add an explicit `!` line for it.
/*

!/.gitignore
!/README.md
!/AGENTS.md
!/MAP.md
!/tsc-dev
!/bin/

# Machine-local state, regenerable — never shared:
#   .tscircuit-repos.txt  cache of org repo names (refresh with gh, see AGENTS.md)
#   .worktrees/           isolated PR worktrees created by `./tsc-dev pr`
